Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everything that brought\Nyou and Rem together is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your excuse for killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned anything\Nover the past hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even regenerate the\Nscars they carved into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:02:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's symbolic of your foolish\Nwaste of energy on this garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not your right to\Ndecide whether they live or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They deserve a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the use in growing up if the only\Nthing that grows is your sentimentalism?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still a\Ngood-for-nothing pathetic whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what we're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to take this garbage\Nand get rid of it forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you made of me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:03:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you actually aiming at me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eriks? Eriks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you planning\Non staying in bed, Eriks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, get up! Eriks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you gotta let us on this bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might try and take\Nthis town. I have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me on this bus while we're standing\Nhere arguing it could be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a ticket to ride,\Nmister, and I don't give a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.64,0:03:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave your price, I'll pay anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There sure seems to be an awful\Nlot of tension in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you just arrived. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you have my sympathy because\Nyou're never going to leave this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This town has been completely\Ntaken over by bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to make matters worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they say that crazy fella Vash\Nthe Stampede is running the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sheriff went out to\Nnegotiate with the varmints,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when he came back, he had\Ndoubled his weight in lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walking into this town is like\Nwalking into a giant spider's web.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legendary gunman's behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is the man who turned\Ntwo of the seven cities into
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ashes and was called mankind's\Nfirst localized disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some folks say he put that\Nhuge crater in the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you'd have to\Nbe nuts to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:04:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whether the legend is true or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one thing I do know is this\Ntown is in some big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, friend, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a traveling priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be useful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't need anything formal, just\Nsome help with the funerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took out the chaplain a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's only Lena.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what's the big hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was wondering if you\Ncould hide me somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you do this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.65,0:05:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pedophile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserved a good thump.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he did was grab a rear end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you keep your mouth shut?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm afraid so, and they\Nweren't real happy about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least I don't think\Nthey saw me come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not funny, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what she says is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wasn't done eating yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's a little girl who\Nstruck my face with her heel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got a price to pay\Nand I'm here to collect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That heel looks more\Nlike a whole footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see why he's upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does ruin his boyish good looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy says he saw her enter that bar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's wrong, he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.57,0:06:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I like to kill scum\Nwho waste my precious time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any event, this problem will be settled\Nin approximately three miniscule seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one, he dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eriks, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, hi there, Mr. Bandit Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sorry you didn't find it funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.84,0:07:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say that she's\Nonly a little 12-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, have a heart, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send out the kid now or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.84,0:07:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you want to kill her\Nor cause her some kind of harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't even ask for a free favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about if I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you let her off the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eriks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's not\Ngood enough, blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna go down on all fours,\Nthe least you can do is act like a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I expect some real commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally, that means getting naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to keep your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do this,\NEriks! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eriks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eriks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta trust that\Nhe knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just the way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna thank you for the canine tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to give you a nice big tip!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eriks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what happened to this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:08:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta help him! Eriks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happened this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.38,0:09:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if the bull\Nis still inside him, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had to choose between your life and\Nyour pride, what do you think you'd do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I would never\Nstrip butt naked and bark like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talent like that comes\Neasy for a wimp like Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there weren't for that\Nwimp, you two would be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eric's!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poor Eric's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were able to get the\Nbullet out of him safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never understand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one lucky devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who this\Nlegendary gunman thinks he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what in the hell gives him the right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to steal what precious\Nlittle family I have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn him, anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, easy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.30,0:09:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't go doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't last two seconds\Nagainst him, don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, how about\Nyou going to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all a bunch of cowards.\NYou weak young whippersnappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:09:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have no right to order me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get yourself\Nkilled, you stupid old bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't, Lina.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of this is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had just stayed away\Nfrom them, he wouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're quite finished here, could\Nyou please keep the noise down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are other patients here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have Eriks moved\Nto the ward right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lena, let's fetch him a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move him and get\Nthis place cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I didn't see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be all right now. I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just stopped by to\Nsee if I could help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just gonna sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needed it! Doctor! Look\Nat that! Oh my gosh! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an amazing recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've regained consciousness so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Doctor, but could you\Nleave the room for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him strain\Nhimself, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's been a long\Ntime, Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found you, you dumb jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a legendary guy like\Nyou doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have destroyed this entire\Nplanet with that angel arm of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a loss of memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That may be true, but you\Ndo know you did it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have fragmented visions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but more than anything, there's an ache\Nin my heart that tells me I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm the one who put\Nthe hole in the fifth moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay so you did this terrible\Nthing now what are you so
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,afraid of what you can do you're\Nliving an easy retirement no
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's just that i want to live\Nquietly for once so i decided
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to change my name and my way of\Nlife why are you here wolfwood
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What brings you to this town?\NAre you hanging around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good laugh, actually. I came\Nto take you away. To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're asking me for a final\Ndestination i have absolutely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no idea however the one thing\Ni do know is i need your help
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i spent a lot of time combing\Nthrough augusta trying to find you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does the name frank marlin happen to ring\Na bell all i did was mention your name
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he fixed the gun\Nfor free. Maybe why give
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it to me huh i thought you might need it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what i need what i want is to\Nlive my life here with them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why was he hospitalized the last\Ntime lena he tried to stop a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Violent drunk at the bar and\Nended up getting punched himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about the time before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fell off at Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, be sure you remember to thank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I'll remember, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in horrible shape. You poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have been through\Nan awful lot. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take good care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're staying here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever I do anything,\Npeople die. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want this pathetic\Nlittle existence so bad
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you'd give up everything\Nelse then go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you familiar
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the town called Carcasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a tiny town on the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Southern Cornelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something really strange\Nhappened there about six
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems the entire population suddenly\Ndisappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no sign of even\Nthe slightest struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything in town looked
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,completely normal except that all the\Npeople had vanished like a mirage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sent in the cavalry and searched the\Nplace over but didn't find a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.52,0:15:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cavalryman did discover\Nsomething very odd though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a man's name, painted on the\Nmonument in the middle of the town square.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was one word, carefully written in red,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem to\Nmatter how far I travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My destiny is always followed\Nby blood and gun smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The result is the same every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountains of death and debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to come with us, Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't leave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dash, take care of nerves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.77,0:16:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma Cheryl, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got her! What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give it to me, now! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll throw your life away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, they've probably\Nalready killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't argue with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheryl, Cheryl, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I was kind of\Nfond of my new life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hate to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, them's the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's got to get tough around here or
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those maniacs are going\Nto destroy this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.54,0:17:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone to stay where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gone to get Lina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 for each of us, huh? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not exactly fair to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't want you\Nkilling anyone, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just ask me not to breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thou shalt not kill, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of church man are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, deja vu, I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're starting to\Nsound like you ain't so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eriks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I have to go and talk\Nto someone this filthy anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I must be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did those two manage to take\Ncare of all them thugs by themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone\Nso horrifyingly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.12,0:19:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your mind is made up, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.86,0:19:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I hate to\Ndo this to you and Lina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything we can do, Eriks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if you'd tell me about\Nit, I could help somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you see, if I did, I'd only\Nbe putting you and Lina in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you have a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could end up alone again\Nwith no one there to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what worries us the\Nmost about your leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have guessed that\NEriks was Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to think that all this time we were\Nconvinced that this pig man was Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:20:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you think the legendary gunman's\Ngonna stick around these parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot, don't even go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't we suffered enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we oughta run him out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She cried, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, no, I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess maybe I was acting\Njust a little bit too pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Preacher, please take good care of Eriks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, he's a bumbling fool of a\Ngoody-goody and a sweet, gentle soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lena and I have always\Nknown somewhere deep
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in our hearts it was too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew Eriks would probably\Nhave to leave us someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet we chose not to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bless him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't change the fact that\Nwe're losing a member of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood, don't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lena.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only wanted to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But somehow, it turned\Nout the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.28,0:21:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.86,0:21:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.27,0:22:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.28,0:22:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Lina.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.19,0:22:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me who should be saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lina, thank you, and goodbye for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.08,0:22:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the blue sky, the wind\Nblows towards the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.16,0:22:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light of the day under the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.20,0:23:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.68,0:23:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.76,0:24:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strong will can stir the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.14,0:24:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a will too strong can cut\Noff the heart's visibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.82,0:24:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sorrow of a man bereaved\Nof his family turns into hate,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.44,0:24:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which eventually metamorphoses\Ninto the intent to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man's finger reaches for the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.00,0:24:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sins change people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.94,0:24:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sin begets sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.70,0:24:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I, I still want to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to believe in the heart,\Nthe heart that feels the sin.

